    "Automation" : {
      "comment" : "A section in the analytics settings view that allows the user to configure automation settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatisering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AV1 encoding uses SVT-AV1 (software). No hardware acceleration available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AV1-koding bruker SVT-AV1 (programvare). Ingen maskinvareakselerasjon tilgjengelig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available" : {
      "comment" : "A label indicating that the SSIMULACRA2 tool is available.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tilgjengelig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AVC-Intra 50 uses the least bandwidth and is suited for SD/720p. AVC-Intra 100 is the standard for 1080i/1080p broadcast delivery. AVC-Intra 200 provides the highest quality with full 10-bit 4:2:2 at higher bitrates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AVC-Intra 50 bruker minst båndbredde og passer for SD/720p. AVC-Intra 100 er standard for 1080i/1080p kringkastingsleveranser. AVC-Intra 200 gir høyest kvalitet med fullt 10-bit 4:2:2 på høyere bitrater."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AVC-Intra Class" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AVC-Intra klasse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AVIF offers the best compression and quality for animated images. GIF is universally compatible but limited to 256 colors. APNG supports full-color transparency and is widely supported in web browsers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AVIF gir best komprimering og kvalitet for animerte bilder. GIF er universelt kompatibel, men begrenset til 256 farger. APNG støtter full-farge gjennomsiktighet og støttes bredt i nettlesere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid special characters like em dashes (—) in prefix, suffix, or comments. They may cause metadata to not be written correctly." : {
      "comment" : "A tooltip explaining the importance of not using special characters in the prefix, suffix, or comments.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unngå spesialtegn som tankestrek (—) i prefiks, suffiks eller kommentarer. Det kan føre til at metadata ikke blir skrevet riktig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
