    "The app includes a bundled ffmpeg binary. You can optionally point at a Homebrew or custom ffmpeg if you need specific features or codecs. ffprobe is no longer bundled — it's only used for chapter extraction and can be configured under Metadata settings." : {
      "comment" : "A description of ffmpeg and ffprobe.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The app includes bundled ffmpeg and ffprobe binaries. You can optionally use custom versions (e.g., from Homebrew) if you need specific features or codecs." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the bundled ffmpeg and ffprobe binaries included with the app, and an option to use custom versions.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appen inkluderer medfølgende ffmpeg- og ffprobe-binærfiler. Du kan eventuelt bruke egendefinerte versjoner (f.eks. fra Homebrew) hvis du trenger spesifikke funksjoner eller kodeker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app-downloaded yt-dlp has slower startup (~20-30 seconds). For faster downloads, install via Homebrew." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appen som er lastet ned med yt-dlp har tregere oppstart (~20–30 sekunder). For raskere nedlastinger, installer via Homebrew."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The date tag precedes any custom comment you enter on the video card." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the functionality of the \"Include date tag on new files\" toggle in the Metadata Settings view.",
