    },
    "Tip: In both the Trim Player and the Fullscreen Player, enter + or - before a number to jump that many seconds forward or backward. If the frame counter is active you will instead jump that many frames." : {
      "comment" : "A random tip string.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips: I både Trim-spilleren og Fullskjerms-spilleren, skriv + eller - foran et tall for å hoppe så mange sekunder fram eller tilbake. Hvis rammeregistratoren er aktiv, vil du i stedet hoppe så mange bilder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In both the Trim Player and the Fullscreen Player, you can start typing a number to enter a timecode. Press enter to jump to that timecode." : {
      "comment" : "A random tip to be displayed in the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips: I både Trim Player og Fullscreen Player kan du begynne å skrive et tall for å angi en tidskode. Trykk enter for å hoppe til den tidskoden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In both the Trim Player and the Fullscreen Player, you can use arrow keys to jump between frames." : {
      "comment" : "A random tip from the list of tips.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips: I både Trim Player og Fullscreen Player kan du bruke piltastene for å hoppe mellom rammer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In both the Trim Player and the Fullscreen Player, you can use JKL to play backwards, pause, and play forwards. Just like in most NLEs." : {
      "comment" : "Random tip to be displayed in the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tip: Både i Trim-spilleren og Fullskjerm-spilleren kan du bruke JKL for å spille bakover, pause og spille fremover. Akkurat som i de fleste NLE-er."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In the Audio Routing overlay use Control + M to mute all audio. You can also use Command + [1...8] to enable or disable a specific audio source track." : {
      "comment" : "Note that the same tip is repeated twice here to ensure there are enough tips to choose from.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips: I Audio Routing-overlayet bruk Control + M for å dempe all lyd. Du kan også bruke Command + [1...8] for å aktivere eller deaktivere en spesifikk lydkildebane."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In the Crop view you can also use Command + [1...8] to switch between different crop modes. Use CMD + ↑←↓→ to move the crop box. Use CMD + -/+ to resize the crop box." : {
      "comment" : "A random tip from the list of tips.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips: I beskjæringsvisningen kan du også bruke Kommando + [1...8] for å bytte mellom forskjellige beskjæringsmoduser. Bruk CMD + ↑←↓→ for å flytte beskjæringsboksen. Bruk CMD + -/+ for å endre størrelse på beskjæringsboksen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In the full screen player press A to turn on Auto Next. This will automatically play the next item in the queue. Command + L when Auto Next is on, will activate looping, so that you can watch the entire queue on repeat." : {
      "comment" : "Random tip displayed in the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips: Trykk på A i fullskjermspilleren for å slå på Auto-neste. Dette vil automatisk spille av neste element i køen. Kommando + L når Auto-neste er på, vil aktivere repetisjon, slik at du kan se hele køen om igjen og om igjen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: In the full screen player the UI overlay disappears immidiately if you place the mouse on the very right side of the screen." : {
      "comment" : "Random tip from the list of tips.",
